sequenceDiagram
  autonumber
  actor Browser
  participant App as Application
  participant OAuth as DiscordOAuthClient
  participant State as OAuthStateStore
  participant Discord as Discord OAuth2 API
  participant Credentials as OAuthCredentialStore
  participant Session as SessionManager

  Browser->>App: GET /auth/discord
  App->>OAuth: beginLogin(returnTo, locale)
  OAuth->>State: put(hash(state), hash(browser nonce), expiry)
  OAuth-->>App: authorization URL and HttpOnly nonce cookie
  App-->>Browser: Set-Cookie and redirect
  Browser->>Discord: authorization request with state
  Discord-->>Browser: redirect with code and state
  Browser->>App: GET callback + nonce cookie
  App->>OAuth: completeLogin(code, state, nonce)
  OAuth->>State: consume(hash(state))
  State-->>OAuth: one record or null
  OAuth->>Discord: exchange code
  Discord-->>OAuth: access and refresh tokens
  OAuth->>Discord: GET current user and guilds
  Discord-->>OAuth: user and guild list
  OAuth->>Credentials: store encrypted token record
  OAuth->>Session: create new opaque session
  Session-->>OAuth: raw token once and stored hash
  OAuth-->>App: user, guilds, session cookie, local return path
  App-->>Browser: clear nonce cookie, set session cookie, redirect
